    </custom_item>

    <if>
      <condition type:"AND">
        <custom_item>
          type        : RPM_CHECK
          description : "libreswan installed"
          rpm         : "libreswan-0.0.0-0"
          operator    : "gt"
          required    : YES
        </custom_item>
      </condition>

      <then>
        <custom_item>
          type            : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK
          description     : "1.19 ALMA-09-003870"
          info            : "AlmaLinux OS 9 IP tunnels must use FIPS 140-3 approved cryptographic algorithms.

GROUP ID: V-269122
RULE ID: SV-269122r1184087

Overriding the system crypto policy makes the behavior of the Libreswan service violate expectations and makes the system configuration more fragmented."
          solution        : "Configure Libreswan to use the systemwide cryptographic policy.

Add the following line to \"/etc/ipsec.conf\":

include /etc/crypto-policies/back-ends/libreswan.config"
          reference       : "800-171|3.1.13,800-171r3|03.13.08,800-53|AC-17(2),800-53r5|AC-17(2),CCI|CCI-000068,CN-L3|7.1.2.7(g),CN-L3|7.1.3.1(d),CN-L3|8.1.4.1(c),CSF|PR.AC-3,CSF|PR.PT-4,CSF2.0|PR.AA-05,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(1),ISO-27001-2022|A.5.14,ISO-27001-2022|A.6.7,ISO/IEC-27001|A.6.2.2,ITSG-33|AC-17(2),LEVEL|1A,NESA|T5.4.2,NIAv2|AM37,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.3,PCI-DSSv4.0|2.2.7,QCSC-v1|3.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.1,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,Rule-ID|SV-269122r1184087_rule,STIG-ID|ALMA-09-003870,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.6,Vuln-ID|V-269122"
          see_also        : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/27039"
          file            : "/etc/ipsec.conf /etc/ipsec.d/*.conf"
          regex           : "^[\\s]*include[\\s]+/etc/crypto-policies/back-ends/libreswan\\.config[\\s]*$"
          expect          : "^[\\s]*include[\\s]+/etc/crypto-policies/back-ends/libreswan\\.config[\\s]*$"
          file_required   : NO
          min_occurrences : "1"
          string_required : NO
        </custom_item>
      </then>

      <else>
        <report type:"PASSED">
          description : "1.19 ALMA-09-003870"
          info        : "AlmaLinux OS 9 IP tunnels must use FIPS 140-3 approved cryptographic algorithms.

GROUP ID: V-269122
RULE ID: SV-269122r1184087

Overriding the system crypto policy makes the behavior of the Libreswan service violate expectations and makes the system configuration more fragmented."
          solution    : "Configure Libreswan to use the systemwide cryptographic policy.

